From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:30:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: recover broken AAC framing from cached HLS

Phone logs show the Matroska AAC filter failing inside an FFmpeg worker whose error does not reach the session callback. A completed local HLS plan can retry once with AAC audio recovery and stream-copy video. Verify both stream durations before recording a complete file, and keep verified local output when the queued task is paused. Mihon and Animeko use different media paths.
